@startuml dataflow_micro_content_pipeline
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam SequenceArrowThickness 1.5

title Data Flow: Micro-Content Generation Pipeline\n(Indexed Chunks -> Lesson Card Drafts)

actor "Instructor" as Instructor
participant "web-bff\n(Next.js)" as Web
participant "core-api" as Core
database "PostgreSQL\nchunks + LO + cards" as PG
participant "Outbox Poller\n(in core-api)" as Outbox
queue "Redis\nBullMQ" as Redis
participant "enrichment-worker" as Enrich
database "Neo4j\nKnowledge Graph" as Neo4j
database "Qdrant\nlearning_chunks" as Qdrant
participant "LLM\nGemini" as LLM

== 0. Precondition ==
note over PG, Qdrant
  Document / Video pipeline reached INDEXED.
  Chunks and transcript segments are searchable in Qdrant.
end note

== 1. Request lesson cards (Outbox-driven) ==
Instructor -> Web : Generate Micro-Content\n(course / chapter / section)
Web -> Core : POST /content-generations\n{type=card, scope}
Core -> PG : BEGIN\nINSERT content_generation_requests\nINSERT outbox_events (ContentGenerationRequested)\nCOMMIT
Core --> Web : {request_id, status=QUEUED}

== 2. Outbox Poller dispatches job ==
Outbox -> PG : SELECT pending outbox_events
Outbox -> Redis : enqueue ContentGenerationRequested\n{type=card, scope}
Outbox -> PG : UPDATE outbox_events status=PROCESSED

== 3. Aggregate grounding context ==
Enrich -> Redis : consume ContentGenerationRequested
Enrich -> PG : SELECT chunks by heading_path L2
Enrich -> Neo4j : SELECT related LO / Chapter
Neo4j --> Enrich : LO statements + prerequisite concepts
Enrich -> Qdrant : retrieve supporting chunks\nfilter={course_id, lo_ids}
Qdrant --> Enrich : grounding_chunks[]
Enrich -> Enrich : aggregate context\nlimit <= 4000 tokens

== 3. Generate cards (strict JSON schema) ==
loop each lesson unit
    Enrich -> LLM : generate_lesson_card\n(context, LO, JSON schema)
    LLM --> Enrich : {title, key_insights[], bullets[]}
    Enrich -> Enrich : validate schema + sanitize markdown
end

== 4. Persist draft ==
Enrich -> PG : INSERT lesson_cards\nstatus=GENERATED_DRAFT\nsource_chunk_ids, lo_ids
Enrich -> Redis : publish ContentDraftGenerated\n{type=card}

== 5. Notify UI ==
Redis --> Web : progress + draft ready
Web --> Instructor : show card in Review Inbox

@enduml
